# (SUPERSEDED for the lab: no Docker; vendor .deb repo below is used instead. The image pin is kept for reference.)
# Collabora CODE 26.04.6.1.1 (image pushed 2026-11-07); same tag the official
# opencloud-compose weboffice/collabora.yml pins at commit d4695d2.
# https://hub.docker.com/r/collabora/code/tags  (manifest-list digest below)
# https://github.com/opencloud-eu/opencloud-compose/blob/d4695d235639f7b14b63efef12d67cfbaab557a6/weboffice/collabora.yml
